WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:08.896
This is Anthropic, Read Aloud. Today: Anthropic launches roadshow for proposed initial public offering.

2
00:00:10.196 --> 00:00:14.219
Anthropic launches roadshow for proposed initial public offering.

3
00:00:14.669 --> 00:00:19.080
From Anthropic Newsroom, published November 10, 2026.

4
00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:27.518
Today Anthropic, P B C launched the roadshow for its proposed initial public offering of its Class A common stock.

5
00:00:27.968 --> 00:00:54.114
The proposed offering consists of 825000000 shares of Class A common stock. Of these, 801351354 shares are being offered by Anthropic and 23648646 shares are being offered by certain existing stockholders. Anthropic will not receive any proceeds from the sale of shares by the selling stockholders.

6
00:00:54.234 --> 00:01:06.300
Anthropic also expects to grant the underwriters a 30-day option to purchase up to an additional 123750000 shares of its Class A common stock.

7
00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:23.140
The initial public offering price is expected to be between 70.00 dollarsand 78.00 dollarsper share. Anthropic has applied to list its Class A common stock on the Nasdaq Global Select Market under the symbol “ANT.”

8
00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:53.109
The proposed offering will be made only by means of a prospectus. Copies of the preliminary prospectus may be obtained from: Goldman Sachs and Co. LLC, Attention: Prospectus Department, 200 West Street, New York, NY 10282, by telephone at (866) 471 to 2526, or by email at prospectus-ny@ny.email.gs.com; or Morgan Stanley and Co.

9
00:01:53.229 --> 00:02:01.498
LLC, Attention: Prospectus Department, 180 Varick Street, 2nd Floor, New York, NY 10014.

10
00:02:01.948 --> 00:02:19.378
A registration statement relating to these securities has been filed with the U S Securities and Exchange Commission but has not yet become effective. These securities may not be sold, nor may offers to buy be accepted, prior to the time the registration statement becomes effective.

11
00:02:19.498 --> 00:02:41.215
Today’s announcement does not constitute an offer to sell or the solicitation of an offer to buy these securities, nor shall there be any sale of these securities in any state or jurisdiction in which such offer, solicitation, or sale would be unlawful prior to registration or qualification under the securities laws of any such state or jurisdiction.

12
00:02:42.215 --> 00:03:00.803
That was Anthropic launches roadshow for proposed initial public offering, from Anthropic Newsroom, published November 10, 2026. Read the original at anthropic dot com. This unofficial audio edition was generated automatically for the podcast Anthropic, Read Aloud.
